## Extensions

URL: https://appwrite.io/docs/products/databases/postgresql/extensions

PostgreSQL exposes a rich extension ecosystem: PostGIS for geospatial data, pgvector for embeddings, pg_trgm for fuzzy search, and more. Native PostgreSQL databases on Appwrite support managing extensions through the API, at no extra cost.

